      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-d/q8-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"= 9π[1 + 4 + 16 + 64 + · · · + 262144]. The ten areas have first term 9π and common ratio 4. [B1] [A1] Their sum is 9π(410 −1)/(4 −1) = 3145725π . [M1] [M1] [A1] Source clarification. The printed wording describes the line of centres: The dimension arrows span the outer edges of the row: This worked solution follows those arrows:\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
