      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-d/q10-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"Multiplying by 100 gives 16 = 3t + 1, hence 3t = 15, so t = (16/100 −1/100)/(3/100) . [M1] [A1] = 5 years\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
